+does not start at time 0 it differs from the AUMC over the same interval
+here.
+}
+
 \seealso{
 \code{\link[=PKNCA.options]{PKNCA.options()}}, \code{\link[=interp.extrap.conc.dose]{interp.extrap.conc.dose()}}
 
